/-!
# MiniRust Specification Anchors (`Anneal.MiniRust.Anchors`)

Links curated semantic clauses across `Anneal.MiniRust` (`Syntax`, `Memory`,
`Machine`, `Translate`) to verbatim excerpts in the vendored upstream
specification under `anneal/vendor/minirust/spec/` (commit
`d821c6e3a3d358fa8a556774dc12b4aa5d0d65ed`).

Checked mechanically by `anneal/ci/check_minirust_pin.py --check-anchors`,
which verifies that every `leanSymbol` resolves to a declared symbol in
`Anneal/MiniRust/*.lean` and every `excerpt` appears verbatim in its pinned
upstream specification file.
-/

/-- A verbatim anchor linking a formalized Lean declaration to its upstream
MiniRust specification file and excerpt. -/
structure SpecAnchor where
  id : String
  leanSymbol : String
  specFile : String
  excerpt : String

/-- Curated MiniRust specification anchors covering syntax, types, values,
